/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 52 0 R
/E (This simple, easy-to-use website/app has been created to assist users with organizing their personal finances. Many individuals struggle with controlling their spending or tracking how much money is spent. The Simple Budget Planner System provides users with a simple method to manage their income, expenses, and monthly budgets.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
72 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 52 0 R
/E (Users can add income from various sources, such as job-related income, allowance, or freelance work. Users can also input daily purchases into different categories \(food, transportation, shopping, utilities\). All transactions are stored and displayed in a manner that allows users to review their financial transactions at any time.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
73 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 52 0 R
/E (The system will automatically calculate the remaining balance after each transaction, which gives users instant awareness of their current financial position. Users also have the option to establish a monthly budget, and the system will notify users when they are nearing their monthly budget limit. This allows users to make better financial decisions to avoid overspending.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
74 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 52 0 R
/E (The Simple Budget Planner Software is designed in a very simple and clear manner and is easy for all user groups to operate, mainly students, employed individuals, and those who have limited knowledge related to personal finances. The Simple Budget Planner Software can be accessed via smartphones and computers for easy, convenient, and broad access to financial information.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
